WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.860
May all be happy,

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:03.730
may all be free from illness.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.940
This is the word of the Lord:

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.270
that no one,

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:10.170
no one He has sent into this world,

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:11.820
should He wish to see suffer.

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:14.500
May they be healthy, may they be graceful,

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:15.620
may they prosper —

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:19.690
such is the wish of the Supreme Father.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.570
But by his own deeds, man

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:27.300
leads himself down the wrong paths,

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.430
and that is why he suffers.

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:31.200
In the days ahead,

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.100
on 8 November,

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:38.510
to receive Maa Lakshmi's special grace,

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:42.590
if the rite is performed by learned acharyas,

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:46.040
a truly powerful blessing

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.510
comes to the yajmaan.
